# Kotoba compile output. `clj/target/` is where run_parity.cljs puts the
# compiled `:js-kotoba-v1` artifact; `target/` is the same thing produced by a
# hand-run `kotoba -M compile` from the repo root. Both are regenerated by the
# compiler from `kotoba/**.kotoba` and neither is a source of truth.
/target/
/clj/target/
